# The window script is load-bearing text, not a source file to normalise:
# Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads a BOM-less .ps1 as ANSI and turns every Chinese
# label into mojibake. Never let a checkout or a diff tool rewrite it.
lib/window.ps1 -text -whitespace=nowarn

# Everything else is plain LF text.
* text=auto eol=lf
